--- !u!114 &574519550
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 574519549}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2f9eb3d1945ff1640a88058f7d4f2b42, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Neo.Rpg.Demo::Neo.Samples.ModuleDemoSceneInfo
  _moduleName: "Neo.Animations \xB7 value and transform animators"
  _purpose: 'One small component per animated value: a number (FloatAnimator), a
    colour (ColorAnimator), a vector (Vector3Animator) or a whole local pose (TransformAnimator).
    The value animators only publish values; you bind them to any target.'
  _runtimeApi: Play / Pause / Resume / Stop; AnimationType, AnimationSpeed; CurrentValue
    / CurrentColor / CurrentVector; ManualUpdate + Tick(dt); TransformAnimator.Settings
    channels and Shake(strength).
  _sceneWorkflow: "Select a disc under [Demo] World: OnVectorChanged / OnColorChanged
    are wired to Transform.localScale / SpriteRenderer.color in the Inspector. The
    card bar row carries the FloatAnimator (Value.OnChanged \u203A Image.fillAmount)."
  _verification: 'Enter Play Mode: the left disc pulses, the middle one shifts colour,
    the bar fills, the square spins and bobs. Pause holds every value; Stop freezes
    the value animators and returns the square to its base pose.'
  _showRuntimeOverlay: 1
  _corner: 0
  _accentColor: {r: 0.55, g: 0.45, b: 0.95, a: 1}
  _backgroundColor: {r: 0.11764706, g: 0.11764706, b: 0.15686275, a: 0.8509804}
  _panelWidth: 420
  _startCollapsed: 0
  _hints:
  - "Playback, type, speed and channels \u203A AnimatorsDemoController \u203A the
    animator API"
  - Type and speed are shared by the three value animators
  - Shake() impulse is wired straight to TransformAnimator.Shake (NoCode)
  _overlayRoot: {fileID: 1928528842}
  _titleLabel: {fileID: 1483319288}
  _descriptionLabel: {fileID: 905082219}
  _hintsLabel: {fileID: 2004627487}
  _collapseLabel: {fileID: 2013835513}
  _collapsibleParts:
  - {fileID: 1860344302}
  - {fileID: 476274548}
