  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#8C73F2>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> Play / Pause / Resume
    / Stop; AnimationType, AnimationSpeed; CurrentValue / CurrentColor / CurrentVector;
    ManualUpdate + Tick(dt); TransformAnimator.Settings channels and Shake(strength).\n<color=#8C73F2>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select a disc under [Demo] World: OnVectorChanged / OnColorChanged
    are wired to Transform.localScale / SpriteRenderer.color in the Inspector. The
    card bar row carries the FloatAnimator (Value.OnChanged \u203A Image.fillAmount).\n<color=#8C73F2>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Enter Play Mode: the left disc pulses, the middle one shifts
    colour, the bar fills, the square spins and bobs. Pause holds every value; Stop
    freezes the value animators and returns the square to its base pose.\n<color=#8C73F2>\xBB</color> 
    Playback, type, speed and channels \u203A AnimatorsDemoController \u203A the
    animator API\n<color=#8C73F2>\xBB</color>  Type and speed are shared by the three
    value animators\n<color=#8C73F2>\xBB</color>  Shake() impulse is wired straight
    to TransformAnimator.Shake (NoCode)"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
